1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,149
Woman: Hey, did you ever return that architecture book you borrowed from the library?

2
00:00:08,149 --> 00:00:11,120
Man: Not yet. I was planning to drop it off tomorrow.

3
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,861
Woman: You might want to go sooner.

4
00:00:12,861 --> 00:00:17,090
I heard a few people in our class are waiting to use it for the group project.

5
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:20,540
Man: Oh no, I didn't realize they were in such high demand

6
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,040
Can't they just look at the online version?

7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,265
Woman: Yes, but the photos aren't as sharp.

8
00:00:25,265 --> 00:00:29,160
There are some design details that are easier to see in the larger version.

9
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:34,072
Man: Right. In that case, I'll take it back this afternoon right after lunch.

10
00:00:34,072 --> 00:00:37,230
If anybody asks, tell them it'll be there then.
